{title: Receive Him Today}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

>Lyrics

(8 Measure Introduction)

Verse 1

Praise the name of Jesus evermore;

Lift His name on high!

Shout hosanna as we lift His praise

Upward to the sky!

He's the Lord, our Redeemer,

The pardon for our sin.

He's the Rock of Salvation,

So let the Savior in.

Receive what He came to give;

Believe, and you too shall live,

Receive what He came to give

Today!

Praise the name of Jesus evermore:

In Him we're born anew!

Come to Jesus, lay your burden down,

And peace He'll give to you.

He's the Lord, our Redeemer,

The pardon for our sin.

He's the Rock of Salvation,

So let the Savior in.

Receive what He came to give;

Believe, and you too shall live,

Receive what He came to give

Today!

Receive Him today!

Receive Him today!

(Pregnant Pause)

He's the Lord, our Redeemer,

The pardon for our sin.

He's the Rock of Salvation,

So let the Savior in.

Receive what He came to give;

Believe, and you too shall live,

Receive what He came to give

Today!

Receive Him today!

Receive Him today!
